  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:be51fc26-fc0c-4898-93e1-7b96a81df3be">
              <SHORT-NAME>Rte</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the Rte (Runtime Environment) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Rte（Runtime Environment）是AUTOSAR软件架构中的一个核心组件，负责在应用软件组件（SW-Cs）和底层基础软件之间提供通信和操作的接口。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：Rte配置需要遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于通信机制、事件处理和数据交换的规定；配置时需考虑系统的实时性和资源限制；在多核或分布式系统中，需特别注意跨核或网络通信的配置和优化。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:666271c7-6518-49d1-bae6-d080da3a6dc0">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteBswGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">General configuration parameters of the Bsw Scheduler section.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswGeneral配置项用于定义AUTOSAR RTE与基础软件模块（BSW）之间的通用配置参数，这些参数控制RTE与BSW交互的行为和性能。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteBswGeneral时，需要确保参数设置与系统需求相匹配，避免性能瓶颈；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应保持与BSW模块的兼容性；特别注意版本控制，确保RTE与BSW模块版本兼容。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09061</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <!-->
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4aad112b-e2d6-42c3-9b24-27f5fe3eb984">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteSchMVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables the generation of the SchM_GetVersionInfo() API.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSchMVersionInfoApi 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用调度管理器模块（SchM）的版本信息API，这个API允许软件组件获取SchM的版本信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，通常建议启用版本信息API以支持诊断和维护活动；如果内存或资源受限，可能需要禁用此功能；在配置时，应确保与系统的诊断需求和资源管理策略保持一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <-->
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:af1402cb-7cce-49b2-9736-e8db66dddd3e">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteBswModuleInstance</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Represents one instance of a Bsw-Module configured on one ECU.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswModuleInstance用于定义Bsw模块实例，它指定了基础软件模块实例的配置，包括其名称和相关属性，以便在运行时环境中进行管理和调度。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteBswModuleInstance时，确保模块实例名称的唯一性，避免与其他Bsw模块实例名称冲突；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应与BswM配置紧密协作，确保模块间的依赖关系得到正确处理；在多模块系统中，合理规划每个模块实例的资源和优先级，以保证系统的稳定性和性能。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7da6b61c-3790-4579-bbb8-56f8f3eeff7b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteBswImplementationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the BswImplementation for which the Rte /SchM is configured.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswImplementationRef 配置项用于将软件组件中的某个可执行实体（Runnable）与基础软件模块的实现关联起来，确保软件组件能够正确调用底层的基础软件服务。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的基础软件模块实现是存在且可用的；应当遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于模块间调用的规范；在多个软件组件共享同一基础软件服务时，需要特别注意调用的一致性和同步问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09066</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <!-- Note: This is a mandatory configuration item temporarily changed to optional due to validation errors. -->
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>BSW-IMPLEMENTATION</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7bad62dd-8bbc-4c0b-bf17-da3d29df35c8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteBswModuleConfigurationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ECU Configuration Values provided for this BswImplementation.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswModuleConfigurationRef用于指定RTE与BSW模块之间的配置关系，确保RTE能够正确引用到BSW模块的配置参数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的BSW模块配置是存在且正确的；该引用对于实现RTE与BSW模块间的接口调用至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于RteBswModuleConfigurationRef的使用和配置应严格遵循规范要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>ECUC-MODULE-CONFIGURATION-VALUES</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:08cf8b6e-658c-4155-b94c-ea8f896edf86">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteBswEventToTaskMapping</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Maps a BswModuleEntity onto an OsTask based on the activating BswEvent. A BswModuleEntity can be activated by more than one BswEvent and thus be mapped to more than one OsTask. In the case of a BswSchedulableEntity executed via a direct function call this RteBswEventToTaskMapping is still specified but no RteBswMappedToTaskRef element is included. The RteBswPositionInTask parameter is necessary to provide an ordering of events invoked by the same RTE API.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswEventToTaskMapping 用于映射基础软件（Bsw）模块产生的事件到自动代码生成的任务，确保当事件发生时，相应的任务能够被调度执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保事件与任务的映射关系准确无误，避免事件触发时任务调度失败；此配置项对于实现事件驱动的Bsw模块至关重要，需谨慎处理；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于事件到任务的映射提供了详细的规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证系统的可靠性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09065</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <!-->
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a2949613-66e5-410e-8d2f-342d6f979540">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteBswImmediateRestart</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">When RteBswImmediateRestart is set to true the BswSchedulableEntitiy shall be immediately re-started after termination if it was activated by this BswEvent while it was already started.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswImmediateRestart 配置项用于指定在BswM模块请求重启操作系统(OS)后，是否立即重启ECU或延迟到下一个主函数周期。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的使用应当符合ECU的重启策略；需要确保系统在重启前已经完成了所有关键操作，以避免数据丢失或系统不稳定；在实际应用中，应考虑与诊断、通信等其他模块的交互，以确保重启流程的正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This parameter shall not be set to true when the mapped BswEvent refers to a BswSchedulableEntitiy which minimumStartInterval attribute is &gt; 0.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09093</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
