                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Rte/RteOsInteraction/RteSyncPoint</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <-->
                        <!-->
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:71abe22f-c77b-4594-8472-2d6e6b7217b6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteBswEventSuccessorSyncPointRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The RteBswEventSuccessorSyncPointRef is necessary to provide a cross core synchronization in case of BswEvents triggered by the same event source but mapped to tasks belonging to different partitions on different cores.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteBswEventSuccessorSyncPointRef 配置项用于指定Bsw模块事件处理完成后，同步点的引用，以确保事件处理的顺序性和同步性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保引用的同步点在系统中是存在且有效的；同步点的设置应与系统的实时性和调度策略相匹配；在多核或分布式系统中，还需考虑跨核或跨节点的同步问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The synchronization point must be reached by all referencing BswEvents before the execution in all related tasks is continued.

                                                In case of RteBswEventSuccessorSyncPointRef the BswModuleEntity activated by the mapped BswEvent is executed before the synchronization point is entered.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09131</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
