                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d822ac60-5646-4210-a4be-4fc35a19a365">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteGeneration</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container holds the parameters for the configuration of the RTE Generation.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteGeneration配置项涉及AUTOSAR Runtime Environment (RTE) 代码生成的参数和选项，用于控制RTE层的代码生成过程，以符合特定的应用需求和优化目标。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteGeneration时，需要确保选择的参数与系统设计和优化目标一致；不同的配置可能会影响系统性能和内存使用；应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对RteGeneration参数的规定和限制。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09009</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteSystemSignalCompuMethodEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Generate System Signal Compute Methods by RTE.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSystemSignalCompuMethodEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用系统信号的计算方法，这影响信号的解释和处理方式，确保数据的正确转换和表达。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于系统信号的计算方法的启用或禁用应当谨慎处理，以保证系统的兼容性和数据的准确性；此配置项的使用应结合具体的应用场景和系统需求来决定；不正确的配置可能导致数据解释错误，影响系统功能的实现。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: CompuMethodGen is enable.
                                        * false: CompuMethodGen is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteIsrSimplification</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Simplification on ISR API used by RTE.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteIsrSimplification配置项用于RTE使用简化后的中断服务例程（ISR），通过调用简化后的ISR来提高系统的响应速度和效率。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用RteIsrSimplification时，需要确保系统的实时性需求得到满足；只有特权OsApplication的SWC实例才可以使用简化的ISR。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: simplification is enabled.
                                        * false: no simplification.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteEaOptimization</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Optimization on ExclusiveArea for RTE communications.

WARNING: if optimization is enabled, do NOT invoke any RTE APIs inside an ISR (e.g. CDD)!</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteEaOptimization配置项用于优化RTE数据交换过程中使用的临界区保护措施。优化主要应用在SenderReceiver通信，在部分场景下能实现无锁读写，显著提升SR通信的运行效率</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用RteEaOptimization时，需要确保优化策略不会违反数据一致性和原子性要求；优化应当在系统的整体性能评估后启用，以避免潜在的副作用。如果开启该优化，不建议用户自行在用户代码中（尤其是CDD）直接读、写任何RTE生成的内部变量，而应该全部正确地通过RTE提供的API来操作，否则会有数据一致性的风险。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: optimization is enabled.
                                        * false: no optimization.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:eda1bae0-a0c3-450a-a9d8-8c9ecc44429f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteDevErrorDetect 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用运行时环境（RTE）的开发错误检测功能，这有助于在开发阶段识别潜在的错误和异常。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常禁用此功能以优化性能；开发阶段启用此功能可以帮助检测API使用错误；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，应确保此配置与系统的诊断策略一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09008</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
