                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d3d667f-3d74-4fcb-a2c7-f970f249ff82">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteVfbTraceEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The RTE generator shall globally enable VFB tracing when RteVfbTrace is set to &quot;true&quot;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteVfbTraceEnabled 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用虚拟功能总线(VFB)的跟踪功能，这有助于在软件开发和调试阶段监控和诊断组件间的通信。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常应禁用此功能以避免不必要的性能开销；确保在开发和测试环境中正确配置以收集所需的诊断信息；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应符合标准规定的跟踪机制。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09015</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d3d667f-3d74-4fcb-a2c7-f970f249fa45">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DataMappingGenerationOptimization1To1Rport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The RTE generator shall globally enable DataMapping Generation Optimization with 1:1 Rport when this is set to &quot;true&quot;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DataMappingGenerationOptimization1To1Rport配置选项用于优化SenderReceiver通信的ECU间通信场景下的代码，SWC中RequiredPortPrototype和Com RX信号1:1的映射关系时的优化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：开启该配置项后，会根据所有周期性触发的RX信号的周期和映射Port所在Runnable的周期的对比进行优化，该配置项会增加内存消耗以提升性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09015</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d3d667f-3d74-4fcb-a2c7-f970f249fa46">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DataMappingGenerationOptimizationNTo1Rport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The RTE generator shall globally enable DataMapping Generation Optimization with N:1 Rport when this is set to &quot;true&quot;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DataMappingGenerationOptimizationNTo1Rport配置选项用于优化SenderReceiver通信的ECU间通信场景下的代码，SWC中Required PortPrototype和Com RX信号N:1的映射关系时的优化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：开启该配置项后，会对RX N:1场景代码进行优化，该配置项会增加内存消耗以提升性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09015</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d3d667f-3d74-4fcb-a2c7-f970f249fa47">
                      <SHORT-NAME>DataMappingGenerationOptimizationPport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The RTE generator shall globally enable DataMapping Generation Optimization with all period signal-Pport when this is set to &quot;true&quot;.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：DataMappingGenerationOptimizationPport配置选项用于优化SenderReceiver通信的ECU间通信场景下的代码，SWC中Provided PortPrototype和Com TX信号的映射关系时的优化，用于开启TX方向的UpdateOnChange功能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：TX UpdateOnChange功能开启后，RTE会为每一个TX数据生成一个副本用于检测是否变化。该配置项会增加内存消耗以提升性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09015</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
