                <!-->
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:acef0099-d337-475d-aadf-4ac579c2b257">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteImplicitCommunication</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the Implicit Communication behavior to be generated.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteImplicitCommunication 配置项用于定义AUTOSAR软件组件间的隐式通信机制，它允许组件通过共享内存来交换数据，而不需要显式的发送和接收服务。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置隐式通信时，需要确保数据一致性和同步机制得到妥善处理；此外，隐式通信可能会影响系统的可维护性和可测试性，因为数据交换不如显式通信那样明显；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对隐式通信的支持可能有限，需要根据具体的软件架构和应用需求谨慎使用。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4105e34e-2489-4675-a302-ba39a2f67b59">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteCoherentAccess</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If set to true the referenced VariableAccess'es of this RteImplicitCommunication container are in one CoherencyGroup.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteCoherentAccess 是一个配置项，用于确保在读取或写入多个数据元素时，数据的一致性得到保障，防止在并发环境下出现数据不一致的情况。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteCoherentAccess时，需要确保涉及的数据元素在整个读取或写入过程中不会被其他运行实体（Runnable）或中断服务例程（ISR）访问，以维护数据的原子性；此配置项对于实现数据的一致性访问非常关键，特别是在多核或多任务环境中；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循标准的数据一致性和保护机制来配置此项，以确保系统的可靠性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Data values for Coherent Implicit Read Access'es are read before the first reading RunnbaleEntity starts and are stable during the execution of all the reading RunnableEntitys; except Coherent Implicit Write Access'es belongs to the same Coherency Group.
                                        Data values written by Coherent Implicit Write Access'es are available for readers not belonging to the Coherency Group after the last writing RunnableEntity has terminated.

                                        Please note that a Coherent Implicit Data Access can be defined for VariableAccess'es to same and different data element. Nevertheless all Coherent Implicit Data Access'es of one Coherency Group have to be executed in the same task.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09091</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6d2fe021-a6a8-41bf-876e-603aa0fed24e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteImmediateBufferUpdate</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">If set to true the RTE will perform preemption area specific buffer update immediately before (for VariableAccess in the role dataReadAccess) resp. after (for VariableAccess in the role dataWriteAccess) Runnable execution.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteImmediateBufferUpdate 配置项决定了组件间通信时，发送组件的数据是否应该立即更新接收组件的缓冲区。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项通常与数据一致性和运行实体调度策略相关联；需要确保配置与系统的实时性和数据一致性要求相匹配；在配置时要注意不同运行实体间的数据依赖关系，避免潜在的数据竞争或不一致问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
