                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:79c14dff-b2e4-41a6-9358-eee2beb9c801">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteInitializationBehavior</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the initialization strategy for variables allocated by RTE with the purpose to implement VariableDataPrototypes.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteInitializationBehavior配置项定义了AUTOSAR软件组件（SW-C）初始化时的行为，包括组件启动时的初始化策略，如启动时是否执行初始化Runnable。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteInitializationBehavior时，需要确保与软件组件的实际需求相匹配，避免初始化时序问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项支持的初始化行为类型需仔细选择，以符合系统设计要求；不当的初始化行为配置可能导致系统启动时的不确定性或性能问题。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="EN">The container defines a set of  RteSectionInitializationPolicys and one RteInitializationStrategy which is applicable for this set.</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09087</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b35aa018-ac22-4135-a835-3c50cab1b405">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteInitializationStrategy</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Definition of the initialization strategy applicable for the SectionInitializationPolicys selected by RteSectionInitializationPolicy.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteInitializationStrategy 配置项定义了软件组件（SW-C）或运行实体（Runnable）初始化时的策略，这决定了组件在系统启动时或者复位后如何进行初始化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，需要确保初始化策略与系统的启动和复位行为相匹配；选择错误的初始化策略可能会导致系统行为不符合预期；此外，初始化策略应与组件的依赖关系和执行顺序保持一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09089</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:aaed5d67-6de6-84b8-4608-6069ca65006f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_INITIALIZATION_STRATEGY_AT_DATA_DECLARATION</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:bdf5ec6d-5435-81c5-48c2-39a71b40f4da">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_INITIALIZATION_STRATEGY_AT_DATA_DECLARATION_AND_PARTITION_RESTART</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e1b465a-de5e-871a-3050-b925a083eb5b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_INITIALIZATION_STRATEGY_AT_RTE_START_AND_PARTITION_RESTART</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:aaa526d2-37bb-8ba1-2233-0800c607fca8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_INITIALIZATION_STRATEGY_NONE</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:614a2811-2efd-41e7-9109-fb467f80adf2">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteSectionInitializationPolicy</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the SectionInitializationPolicys for which a particular RTE initialization strategy applies.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSectionInitializationPolicy 配置项用于指定AUTOSAR RTE生成代码中，数据元素初始化的策略，决定了数据元素在系统启动时或者分区重启时的初始化行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保初始化策略符合系统的安全和可靠性要求；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，可能需要考虑不同的初始化时机，如系统启动或分区重启；此外，初始化策略的选择应与系统内存管理策略相协调，避免不必要的性能开销。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The SectionInitializationPolicy describes the intended initialization of MemorySections.

                                        The following values are standardized in AUTOSAR Methodology:

                                        * '''NO-INIT''': No initialization and no clearing is performed. Such data elements must not be read before one has written a value into it.
                                        * '''INIT''': To be used for data that are initialized by every reset to the specified value (initValue).
                                        * '''POWER-ON-INIT''': To be used for data that are initialized by &quot;Power On&quot; to the specified value (initValue). Note: there might be several resets between power on resets.
                                        * '''CLEARED''': To be used for data that are initialized by every reset to zero.
                                        * '''POWER-ON-CLEARED''': To be used for data that are initialized by &quot;Power On&quot; to zero. Note: there might be several resets between power on resets.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09088</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
