                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6eec3900-61d9-487c-b0c1-b2c3d946eb59">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteModeSchtblMapSwc</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies an instance of a ModeDeclarationGroupPrototype of a SwComponentPrototype.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteModeSchtblMapSwc配置项用于映射软件组件的模式到调度表，允许基于当前模式触发特定的调度表执行，从而实现模式驱动的行为控制。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保软件组件的模式与调度表之间的映射关系准确无误；此配置项对于实现基于模式的动态调度策略至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于模式管理和调度表的集成有明确的规范，需要遵循这些规范以确保系统的正确行为。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09055</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:bdfe3267-90f3-4abc-aae8-5787c1cde2ee">
                              <SHORT-NAME>RteModeSchtblMapSwcPortRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the PPortPrototype of a SwComponentPrototype.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteModeSchtblMapSwcPortRef配置项用于将软件组件的端口引用映射到模式切换调度表，以便在特定模式下激活相应的调度表。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）确保映射正确反映了软件组件的行为和需求；在配置时需考虑系统的实时性和资源限制；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于模式管理的配置要求严格，需确保遵循相关规范。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09057</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
