                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f0e748db-5d84-4c38-9a6d-ea5ce0fad723">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteOsTaskChain</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container holds the configuration of one task chain configuration.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteOsTaskChain配置项用于定义一系列操作系统任务（OsTask）的执行链，这些任务按照特定的顺序执行，以支持复杂的调度策略和运行时行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteOsTaskChain时，必须确保任务链中的任务顺序与实际的调度逻辑一致；此配置项在设计时需要特别注意任务之间的依赖关系和数据共享问题，以避免死锁或竞态条件；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中没有直接提及RteOsTaskChain，因此具体实现可能会依赖于AUTOSAR RTE生成工具的支持。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09135</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6fd43c38-775e-4410-8e96-548537ee20df">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RtePredecessorOsTaskRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">OsTask which shall chain another OsTask when it terminates.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RtePredecessorOsTaskRef 配置项用于指定一个运行实体（Runnable）在操作系统任务调度中的前驱任务，这有助于定义任务间的依赖关系和调度顺序。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保引用的OsTask存在且配置正确；此配置项通常用于确保任务间的数据一致性和执行顺序；在多核系统中，还需考虑任务跨核调度的影响。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09136</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsTask</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d3134013-2fc6-4ba1-910d-6ec3eb107f64">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteSuccessorOsTaskRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">OsTask which shall be chained from the predecessor OsTask.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSuccessorOsTaskRef 配置项用于指定一个运行实体（Runnable）执行完成后，应当激活的操作系统任务（OsTask）的引用。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保引用的OsTask存在且配置正确；此配置项通常用于运行实体间的任务切换，需要注意任务间的优先级和调度策略；在多核系统中，还需考虑任务的核间迁移和同步问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09137</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsTask</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d0004c0d-70ae-4165-a6cf-50d8e3ae476b">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteSyncPoint</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The RteSyncPoint is necessary to provide an cross core synchronization in case of RteEvents triggered by the same event source but mapped to tasks belonging to different partitions on different cores.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSyncPoint是用于定义在AUTOSAR运行时环境（RTE）中，不同运行实体（Runnable Entities）之间的同步点，以确保数据的一致性和运行的同步。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteSyncPoint时，需要确保同步点的设置不会导致死锁或资源竞争；同步点的使用应当谨慎，以避免过度同步导致的系统性能下降；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于RteSyncPoint的具体实现细节和使用限制有明确规定，需要仔细遵守。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The synchronization point must be reached by all referencing RteEvents before the execution in all related tasks is continued.

                                        In case of Rte(Bsw)EventSuccessorSyncPointRef the ExecutableEntity activated by the mapped event is executed before the synchronization point is entered.

                                        In case of Rte(Bsw)EventPredecessorSyncPointRef the ExecutableEntity activated by the mapped event is executed after the synchronization point is passed.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09127</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f025abf7-c579-4bee-a949-9fc81f463d5d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteUsedOsActivation</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Attributes used in the activation of OsTasks and Runnable Entities.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteUsedOsActivation 配置项指定了AUTOSAR RTE（Run-Time Environment）是否使用操作系统的任务激活机制，这通常与任务的多次激活能力有关。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteUsedOsActivation时，需要确保它与系统设计的任务调度策略相匹配；如果任务不支持多次激活，该选项应设置为false；在多核环境中，还需考虑任务在不同核心间的激活和调度。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09060</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:70132270-1ce0-465b-9a54-bc53328ef71a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteExpectedActivationOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Activation offset in milliseconds.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteExpectedActivationOffset 配置项用于指定运行实体（Runnable）在任务中的预期激活偏移时间，这有助于优化调度和确保时间确定性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）该配置项的值应当小于所在任务的周期；必须确保配置的偏移时间与系统的实时性要求相符；在多核或多任务环境中，还需考虑激活偏移对任务间同步的影响。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">ms</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Important: This is a requirement from the Rte towards the Os/Mcu setup. The Rte Generator shall assume this activation offset to be fulfilled.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09048</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
