                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:71578dd3-b84d-41d5-9d09-59819d85d060">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRips</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container provides the configuration of the Rte Implementation Plug-In support by RTE.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRips（Runtime Environment Received Interface Pointer Signature）配置项定义了接口指针的签名，这是AUTOSAR RTE生成代码中用于接收接口指针的函数的签名。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，RteRips的具体属性应与标准文档中定义的一致，包括函数的返回类型、参数类型和数量；任何偏离可能导致接口不兼容；在多个软件组件共享接口时，确保RteRips的一致性至关重要。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="EN">If the container is NOT defined, the support for Rte Implementation Plug-Ins (RIPS) is globally disabled.</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_89000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
