                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>RTE_RIPS_OFF</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:49a215e8-22e5-8f8a-4b6b-37a7ddc5a752">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_OFF</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:957b3bee-08c9-8481-1f22-02bb509bddac">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RTE_RIPS_ON</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-URI-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:42edaae2-2594-462d-ac93-6690820ba5ea">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsPluginConfigurationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the configuration container of the RTE Implementation Plug-in holding the RTE relevant settings.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsPluginConfigurationRef 是一个配置参数，用于引用实时环境（RTE）中与RIPS（Runtime Infrastructure Plugin System）插件相关的配置设置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteRipsPluginConfigurationRef时，需要确保引用的RIPS插件配置与所使用的AUTOSAR RTE版本兼容；此外，正确的插件配置对于RTE的行为和性能至关重要，因此必须谨慎选择和配置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应检查文档以确认RIPS插件配置的正确引用方式和可用性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">All referenced RTE Implementation Plug-ins are considered for the RTE generation.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_89002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-URI-REF DEST="ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDestinationUriDefSets/RteRipsPlugin</DESTINATION-URI-REF>
                    </ECUC-URI-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <-->
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fa1a7877-8a6a-4f02-967e-a2ad271002c6">
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteSwComponentInstance</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Representation of one SwComponentPrototype located on the to be configured ECU. All subcontainer configuration aspects are in relation to this SwComponentPrototype.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSwComponentInstance配置项定义了软件组件实例在系统中的存在，包括其实例化的组件类型和分配给该实例的资源。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置RteSwComponentInstance时，确保每个实例的标识符唯一，以避免在系统中的冲突；组件实例化应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4中定义的软件组件模型，确保兼容性和一致性；分配资源时考虑实际硬件限制和性能需求，以保证系统的高效运行。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <INTRODUCTION>
                    <P>
                      <L-1 L="EN">The RteSwComponentInstance can be associated with either a  AtomicSwComponentType or ParameterSwComponentType.</L-1>
                    </P>
                  </INTRODUCTION>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09005</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:950d21fa-8dcf-4fee-b7f6-35fb1a5b5698">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteSoftwareComponentInstanceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a SwComponentPrototype.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSoftwareComponentInstanceRef用于标识AUTOSAR软件组件实例的引用，确保系统中的组件能够被正确识别和配置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的软件组件实例在系统中是唯一的；引用应与实际软件组件的定义严格匹配，避免引用错误；在多组件系统中，正确的组件实例引用对于组件间通信至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>SW-COMPONENT-PROTOTYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:55f79a11-b016-4684-baa0-b13ebe872218">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteEventToTaskMapping</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Maps an instance of a RunnableEntity onto one OsTask based on the activating RTEEvent.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteEventToTaskMapping 配置项用于将特定的事件映射到操作系统任务，这样当事件发生时，相应的任务可以被激活以执行相关的运行实体（Runnable）。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保事件与任务之间的映射关系正确无误，以免影响系统的响应性和实时性；此外，应避免一个事件映射到多个任务，以防止资源竞争和调度问题；在多核环境下，还需考虑事件与任务在不同核心间的映射关系，确保系统的并行处理能力。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">In the case of a RunnableEntity executed via a direct function call this RteEventToTaskMapping is still specified but no RteMappedToTask element is included. The RtePositionInTask parameter is necessary to provide an ordering of events invoked by the same RTE API.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <!-->
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5ae7b6fe-0b75-4b15-9605-28ed631e1d6b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteImmediateRestart</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">When RteImmediateRestart is set to true the RunnableEntitiy shall be immediately re-started after termination if it was activated by this RTEEvent while it was already started.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteImmediateRestart 配置项用于指定当软件组件（SW-C）的某个运行实体（Runnable）由于错误而终止执行时，是否应立即重新启动该运行实体。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保系统设计可以容忍立即重启的行为，避免可能的连锁错误；此配置项的使用应结合错误处理策略和系统的实时性要求进行考虑；在配置时，应注意不同运行实体间的依赖关系，以免重启导致数据一致性问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This parameter shall not be set to true when the mapped RTEEvent refers to a RunnableEntity which minimumStartInterval attribute is &gt; 0.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09092</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <-->
                        <!-->
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5e2092d5-ce48-93bb-4152-eb159506b3ae">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteOsSchedulePoint</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Introduce a schedule point by explicitly calling Os Schedule service after the execution of the ExecutableEntity.  The Rte generator is allowed to optimize several consecutive calls to Os schedule into one single call if the ExecutableEntity executions in between have been skipped.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteOsSchedulePoint配置项用于定义AUTOSAR RTE（Runtime Environment）中的调度点，这些调度点是操作系统(OS)允许RTE调度或执行Runnables的特定时刻。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置RteOsSchedulePoint时，需要确保调度点的设置不会违反操作系统的调度策略和时间约束；调度点的选择和配置应优化系统的响应时间和性能；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中应详细定义，但在实际应用中需根据具体OS的能力和限制来调整。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The absence of this parameter is interpreted as &quot;NONE&quot;.

                                                It shall be considered an invalid configuration if the task is preemptable and the value of this parameter is not set to &quot;NONE&quot; or the parameter is absent.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09022</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:15708fa1-5242-e069-e825-e249271df837">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CONDITIONAL</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:e4b45c00-1453-da42-c197-99cab8351583">
                              <SHORT-NAME>NONE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:e0f49ab2-cff4-d998-fad0-35a68071f216">
                              <SHORT-NAME>UNCONDITIONAL</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <-->
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5670c865-e686-46a8-bd05-ee23c3c403d8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteActivationOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Activation offset in milliseconds.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteActivationOffset配置项用于定义在周期性任务中，运行实体（Runnable）的启动偏移时间，以确保运行实体按照特定的时间间隔启动执行。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的设置应小于其所在任务的周期时间，以避免执行时间超出任务周期；在配置时需考虑系统的实时性要求和运行实体的执行时间；对于非周期性任务，此配置项不适用。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">ms</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09018</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">Inf</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:db21f1ca-7010-40dc-b9ea-d83534e9fda0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RtePositionInTask</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each RunnableEntity mapped to an OsTask has a specific position within the task execution.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RtePositionInTask 用于定义某个运行实体（Runnable）在特定任务中的执行顺序位置，确保各Runnables按照预定顺序执行，从而满足系统的功能和时间要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个任务内的RtePositionInTask唯一，避免冲突；合理设计顺序以满足实时性要求；在多核系统中注意跨核调度和执行一致性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">For periodic activation this is the order of execution.
                                                For event driver activation this is the order of evaluation which actual RunnableEntity has to be executed.
                                                In case of direct function calls this parameter is necessary to provide an ordering of events when several ExecutableEntities are invoked by the same RTE API.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09023</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <!-->
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9edea002-e925-48e8-9392-6bf9f42ae9e9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteServerQueueLength</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the length of the queue for the server call serialization. This value overwrites the queueLength specified at the ServerComSpec.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteServerQueueLength 配置项定义了AUTOSAR RTE中服务器组件的队列长度，这个队列用于存储来自客户端组件的请求，直到服务器组件能够处理它们。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）队列长度应根据系统的需求和资源限制来合理配置，以避免资源浪费或请求丢失；过长的队列可能导致延迟增加，而过短的队列可能导致请求丢失；在配置时需要考虑服务器组件的处理能力和客户端请求的频率。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09133</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
