                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:d13b3e1d-b539-415e-b180-5f72e267eb09">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteExclusiveAreaRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ExclusiveArea.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteExclusiveAreaRef 配置项用于指定一个运行实体（Runnable）或者一个内部函数可以访问的独占区域的引用，确保在并发环境中对共享资源的访问是互斥的。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的独占区域已经在系统中定义；独占区域的使用应遵循AUTOSAR的互斥机制规定；正确配置独占区域对于防止数据竞争和提高系统稳定性至关重要。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-TYPE>EXCLUSIVE-AREA</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                        </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:4437449b-4726-45df-a6f9-e5140dac45a4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>RteExclusiveAreaOsResourceRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Optional reference to an OsResource in case RteExclusiveAreaImplMechanism is configured to OS_RESOURCE for this ExclusiveArea.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteExclusiveAreaOsResourceRef用于将AUTOSAR RTE的独占区域与操作系统的资源进行关联，确保在访问共享资源时能够避免数据竞争和条件竞争。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保所引用的OS资源已定义且与独占区域的使用目的相匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求明确独占区域与OS资源的关系，以保证系统的实时性和稳定性；配置不当可能导致系统性能下降或运行时错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09031</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
