                  <SHORT-NAME>RteSwComponentType</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Representation of one SwComponentType for the base of all configuration parameter which are affecting the whole type and not a specific instance.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteSwComponentType定义了软件组件的类型，它是AUTOSAR软件架构中的基本构建块，用于规定软件组件的功能和接口。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，软件组件类型包括应用软件组件(Application Software Component, Swc)和基础软件组件(Basic Software Component, Bswc)；确保每个软件组件的类型正确定义，以便正确实现其功能和通信；软件组件类型的选择直接影响到系统的模块化和可重用性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09006</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
