                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to either AtomicSwComponentType or ParameterSwComponentType.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteComponentTypeRef 配置项用于指定一个软件组件模型（Software Component, SW-C）的类型，它建立了软件组件实例与其类型定义之间的关联。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时，确保引用的组件类型已在系统中定义且可用；组件类型的引用必须与实际的软件组件定义一致；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，组件类型的命名和引用应遵循规范的命名规则。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-TYPE>SW-COMPONENT-TYPE</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                    </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:dc31ff20-0239-4fa1-87e8-3cc367dd94c7">
                      <SHORT-NAME>RteImplementationRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The Implementation which shall be assigned to the SwComponentType.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteImplementationRef是一个配置项，用于指定某个运行实体（Runnable）的实现参考，即链接到具体的源代码实现或函数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：（该配置项VCOS未支持）在配置时需确保引用的实现与运行实体兼容；对于每个Runnable，此配置项是必须的以确保正确的代码生成；在多实现场景下，正确的选择实现参考对于功能的实现至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Rte_09028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
